window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three midlife sister witches are rewriting fate. But no one told them about the backlash.<br> <br> Alys, Maeve, and Siobhan Silver made a promise they have no idea how to keep. Despite their best efforts and understanding of the craft, they are unable to revive a woman trapped by a fae curse. And with the magic council in ruins and the elders in hiding, there’s no one to ask.<br> <br> Until Maeve dreams of an enchanted sword that can break any spell.<br> The quest will send the sisters away from their small-town lives and out into the dangers of the magical underworld where might makes right and only the strong survive.<br> <br> If they’re lucky.<br> <br> <i>Witch Way Today </i>is the fifth book in the Silver Sisters’ paranormal women’s fiction series. If you like stories featuring strong women over forty, magical surprises, and sisterly love, you don’t want to miss Jennifer L. Hart’s enchanting tale. Buy <i>Witch Way Today </i>and embrace the magic within now!\"</p>"; 
